{"id":"6afd53e1-2b34-83ec-b9e0-003c061d14e4","sections":[{"count":5,"heading":"十二、本章綜合習題","html":"<div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-has-border=\"\" style=\"border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-xl); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"between\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">習題 1｜複合狀態變化</strong></span></p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"xs\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">中等</p></div>某理想氣體原本在 27°C、2 atm 下占有 3 L。若溫度升至 127°C、壓力降至 1 atm，且莫耳數不變，求最後體積。<button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"lg\" data-block=\"\" data-d-component=\"button\" data-d-block=\"\" style=\"--scale: 0.995;\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\"><span>收起答案與解析</span><svg width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-d-component=\"icon\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12 8a1 1 0 0 1 .707.293l7 7a1 1 0 0 1-1.414 1.414L12 10.414l-6.293 6.293a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414l7-7A1 1 0 0 1 12 8Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></span></button><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-lg); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">答案：</strong><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">8.0 L</strong></span></p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"sm\">1. 使用綜合氣體定律 P₁V₁/T₁ = P₂V₂/T₂。</p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"sm\">2. T₁ = 300 K，T₂ = 400 K。</p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"sm\">3. V₂ = (2 × 3 × 400)/(1 × 300) = 8.0 L。</p></div></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-has-border=\"\" style=\"border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-xl); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"between\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">習題 2｜由氣體資料判斷分子式</strong></span></p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"xs\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">中等</p></div>某氣態碳氫化合物在 27°C、1 atm 下，密度為 1.14 g/L。已知其最簡式為 CH₂，求分子式。（C=12，H=1）<button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"lg\" data-block=\"\" data-d-component=\"button\" data-d-block=\"\" style=\"--scale: 0.995;\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\"><span>收起答案與解析</span><svg width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-d-component=\"icon\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12 8a1 1 0 0 1 .707.293l7 7a1 1 0 0 1-1.414 1.414L12 10.414l-6.293 6.293a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414l7-7A1 1 0 0 1 12 8Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></span></button><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-lg); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">答案：</strong><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">C₂H₄</strong></span></p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"sm\">1. 由 M = ρRT/P，得到 M ≈ 1.14 × 0.08206 × 300 = 28.1 g/mol。</p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"sm\">2. CH₂ 的式量為 14。</p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"sm\">3. 28.1/14 ≈ 2，因此分子式為 C₂H₄。</p></div></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-has-border=\"\" style=\"border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-xl); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"between\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">習題 3｜限量試劑與氣體體積</strong></span></p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"xs\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">進階</p></div>在相同溫壓下，將 6 L 氫氣與 4 L 氧氣混合並完全反應。反應後冷卻至原溫度，且生成的水完全凝結。求剩餘氣體的體積。<button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"lg\" data-block=\"\" data-d-component=\"button\" data-d-block=\"\" style=\"--scale: 0.995;\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\"><span>收起答案與解析</span><svg width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-d-component=\"icon\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12 8a1 1 0 0 1 .707.293l7 7a1 1 0 0 1-1.414 1.414L12 10.414l-6.293 6.293a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414l7-7A1 1 0 0 1 12 8Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></span></button><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-lg); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">答案：</strong><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">1 L 氧氣</strong></span></p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"sm\">1. 反應式：2H₂ + O₂ → 2H₂O。</p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"sm\">2. 6 L 氫氣需要 3 L 氧氣，氧氣原本有 4 L。</p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"sm\">3. 氫氣完全反應，剩餘氧氣 1 L；水已凝結，不計入氣體體積。</p></div></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-has-border=\"\" style=\"border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-xl); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"between\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">習題 4｜反應前後的壓力</strong></span></p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"xs\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">進階</p></div>在 300 K 的密閉剛性容器中，放入 2 mol 的 A₂ 氣體與 3 mol 的 B₂ 氣體，完全依 A₂ + B₂ → 2AB 反應。若溫度維持不變，且初始總壓力為 5 atm，求反應後總壓力。<button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"lg\" data-block=\"\" data-d-component=\"button\" data-d-block=\"\" style=\"--scale: 0.995;\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\"><span>收起答案與解析</span><svg width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-d-component=\"icon\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12 8a1 1 0 0 1 .707.293l7 7a1 1 0 0 1-1.414 1.414L12 10.414l-6.293 6.293a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414l7-7A1 1 0 0 1 12 8Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></span></button><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-lg); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">答案：</strong><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">5 atm</strong></span></p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"sm\">1. 反應前總莫耳數為 5 mol。</p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"sm\">2. 反應 2 mol A₂ 消耗 2 mol B₂，生成 4 mol AB，剩餘 1 mol B₂。</p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"sm\">3. 反應後總莫耳數為 4+1=5 mol。</p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"sm\">4. 因 V、T 固定，P 與 n 成正比，總壓力維持 5 atm。</p></div></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-has-border=\"\" style=\"border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-xl); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"between\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">習題 5｜觀念整合</strong></span></p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"xs\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">挑戰</p></div>兩個容器裝有不同種類的理想氣體，兩者的壓力、溫度及密度都相同，但容器體積不同。判斷兩種氣體的莫耳質量是否相同，並說明原因。<button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"lg\" data-block=\"\" data-d-component=\"button\" data-d-block=\"\" style=\"--scale: 0.995;\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\"><span>收起答案與解析</span><svg width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-d-component=\"icon\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12 8a1 1 0 0 1 .707.293l7 7a1 1 0 0 1-1.414 1.414L12 10.414l-6.293 6.293a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414l7-7A1 1 0 0 1 12 8Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></span></button><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-lg); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">答案：</strong><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">莫耳質量相同</strong></span></p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"sm\">1. 由 ρ = PM/(RT) 可得 M = ρRT/P。</p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"sm\">2. 兩種氣體的密度、壓力、溫度都相同，因此莫耳質量相同。</p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"sm\">3. 容器體積不同只會影響總質量與總莫耳數，不影響此結論。</p></div></div></div>","messageId":"0a672dcf-255d-45a8-b9e1-ef7c1d663ee1"}]}